    "title": "Lead Plant Manager at Rahu Catalysts",
    "description": "An exciting career opportunity awaits you at Rahu Catalysts. We are on the lookout for a dedicated Plant Manager to strengthen our Indore-based team.\n\nAbout Rahu Catalysts:\nRahu Catalysts is a leading organization in the On-site sector, committed to excellence, innovation, and employee growth. We offer a dynamic work environment where talent is recognized and rewarded.\n\nKey Responsibilities:\n• Coordinate with logistics for dispatching finished goods\n• Coordinate with design and engineering teams on product improvements\n• Implement 5S, Kaizen, and Six Sigma practices on the shop floor\n• Oversee daily production operations to meet output targets\n• Conduct root cause analysis for quality rejections and defects\n• Ensure product quality meets internal and customer specifications\n• Manage supplier quality audits and vendor development\n\nRequired Skills & Qualifications:\n• B.Sc / M.Sc in Life Sciences\n• 1-3 years of relevant experience\n• Proficiency in SAP MM/PP\n• Proficiency in 5S\n• Proficiency in Six Sigma\n• Proficiency in ISO 9001\n• Proficiency in FMEA\n• Proficiency in Lean Manufacturing\n• Proficiency in PPAP\n• Proficiency in Quality Control\n\nWork Mode: On-site - Work from our office\n\nWhat We Offer:\n• Competitive salary with performance-linked incentives\n• Comprehensive health insurance for self and family\n• Employee stock options (ESOPs) for eligible roles\n• Company-sponsored certifications\n• Annual paid leaves and casual leaves\n• Learning & development budget\n• Salary Range: 4 LPA - 9 LPA per annum\n\nLocation: Indore, Madhya Pradesh, India\n\nIf you are excited about this opportunity, apply now and take the next step in your career journey with Rahu Catalysts!",
